Licenses for the binaries in this release
=========================================

The lua and luac executables are built from unmodified PUC-Rio Lua sources. The
Linux executables are statically linked against musl libc; Lua and musl are
distributed under the MIT license. The Windows executables are statically
linked against the MinGW-w64 runtime, whose complete copyright file follows the
musl one at the end of this file. The macOS executables link only the system
library. GCC's own runtime support code in the Linux and Windows executables is
covered by the GCC Runtime Library Exception and needs no notice.


